                                                           rdfs:label "Motivation: CS students need a minimal set of well-established methods and tools to bring to interface construction." .


###  http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__Computer_interface
<http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__Computer_interface> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                    cs2013:LearningOutcome ;
                                                           cs2013:hasKnowledgeUnit <http://purl.org/cs2013/KU/Collaboration_and_Communication> ;
                                                           cs2013:hasMasteryLevel <http://purl.org/cs2013/MasteryLevel/Assessment> ;
                                                           rdfs:label "Motivation: Computer interfaces not only support users in achieving their individual goals but also in their interaction with others, whether that is task-focused (work or gaming) or task-unfocused (social networking)." .


###  http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__Effective_interfac
<http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__Effective_interfac> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                    cs2013:LearningOutcome ;
                                                           cs2013:hasKnowledgeUnit <http://purl.org/cs2013/KU/Human_Factors_and_Security> ;
                                                           cs2013:hasMasteryLevel <http://purl.org/cs2013/MasteryLevel/Usage> ;
                                                           rdfs:label "Motivation: Effective interface design requires basic knowledge of security psychology. Many attacks do not have a technological basis, but exploit human propensities and vulnerabilities. 'Only amateurs attack machines; professionals target people' (Bruce Schneier, https://www.schneier.com/blog/archives/2013/03/phishing_has_go.h.)" .


###  http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__Much_HCI_work_depe
<http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__Much_HCI_work_depe> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                    cs2013:LearningOutcome ;
                                                           cs2013:hasKnowledgeUnit <http://purl.org/cs2013/KU/Statistical_Methods_for_HCI> ;
                                                           cs2013:hasMasteryLevel <http://purl.org/cs2013/MasteryLevel/Familiarity> ;
                                                           rdfs:label "Motivation: Much HCI work depends on the proper use, understanding and application of statistics. This knowledge is often held by students who join the field from psychology, but less common in students with a CS background." .


###  http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__Some_curricula_wil
<http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__Some_curricula_wil> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                    cs2013:LearningOutcome ;
                                                           cs2013:hasKnowledgeUnit <http://purl.org/cs2013/KU/Design_Oriented_HCI> ;
                                                           cs2013:hasMasteryLevel <http://purl.org/cs2013/MasteryLevel/Usage> ;
                                                           rdfs:label "Motivation: Some curricula will want to emphasize an understanding of the norms and values of HCI work itself as emerging from, and deployed within specific historical, disciplinary and cultural contexts." .


###  http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__To_take_a_user_exp
<http://purl.org/cs2013/LO/Motivation__To_take_a_user_exp> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                    cs2013:LearningOutcome ;
                                                           cs2013:hasKnowledgeUnit <http://purl.org/cs2013/KU/Programming_Interactive_Systems> ;
                                                           cs2013:hasMasteryLevel <http://purl.org/cs2013/MasteryLevel/Familiarity> ;
                                                           rdfs:label "Motivation: To take a user-experience-centered view of software development and then cover approaches and technologies to make that happen." .


